# The dashboard's Adversarial review action (sd:5064) reads these from
# <config>/adversarial-gate/.env. Both are optional: without them it runs
# codex with the values below. `adversarial-gate run` itself reads neither.
#
# The codex model id, passed as `codex exec -m`.
# ADVERSARIAL_MODEL=gpt-6-astra
#
# The reasoning effort, passed as `-c model_reasoning_effort=`; one lowercase
# word, such as low, medium or high.
# ADVERSARIAL_EFFORT=high
